            <li><strong>Open <code>2_university.py</code></strong> from the folder you downloaded in Scenario 1.</li>
            <li><strong>Identify Composition:</strong> Look at <code>__init__</code>. The University creates its own <code>Department</code> objects. They are born and die with the University.</li>
            <li><strong>Identify Aggregation:</strong> Look at <code>enroll_student</code>. It accepts a `student` object that exists <em>outside</em>.</li>
            <li><strong>Task:</strong> Complete the loop in <code>show_details</code> to print the names of the aggregated students.</li>
